// Generator: 80 HP, dark metallic box with antenna and emitter sphere.
// Overcharge: doubles shield HP (400), adds PointLight glow, lasts 8s.
// Shield recharges 5 HP/s after 15s of no damage. HUD shows "SHIELD [N]" count.
